## 🛠️ Featured Projects

### 🧠 [MindMirror AI](https://github.com/student-yashsingh/MindMirror-AI)
An emotional journaling platform. A Groq-hosted LLaMA 3.1 model analyzes each entry across 5 dimensions (emotion, confidence, valence, intensity, energy level), with dashboards for mood trends, a 0–100 stability index and AI weekly summaries. It also has a real-time AI chat companion over WebSockets with persistent history.
**Stack:** React.js · FastAPI · MongoDB · Groq API · WebSockets · JWT · Google OAuth · Tailwind CSS
🔗 [Live Demo](https://mind-mirror-ai-theta.vercel.app/) · 📂 [Source Code](https://github.com/student-yashsingh/MindMirror-AI)
> ⏳ Open the [backend link](https://mindmirror-ai-pn1k.onrender.com/) first so the server wakes up, then use the live demo.

### 📹 [Zingle](https://github.com/student-yashsingh/Zingle)
A MERN communication platform with HD video and voice calling, real-time messaging (typing indicators, read receipts, file sharing), and language-partner discovery with friend requests and notifications. The backend has 13 REST API endpoints, secured with JWT, Google OAuth, password hashing and HTTP-only cookies.
**Stack:** React.js · Node.js · Express.js · MongoDB · Stream Video & Chat SDKs · TanStack Query · Tailwind CSS
🔗 [Live App](https://zingle-the-calling-and-chatting-app-3tla.onrender.com) · 📂 [Source Code](https://github.com/student-yashsingh/Zingle)

### 🌿 [EcoReceipt AI](https://ecoreciptai.netlify.app/)
A gamified web app that helps Indian consumers cut their grocery carbon footprint. Gemini 1.5 Flash reads grocery receipts to produce CO₂ scores and eco grades (A+ to F). Online Mode shows live Blinkit products with greener swaps, and a points system with 4 tiers (Bronze to Platinum) and a leaderboard keeps users engaged.
**Stack:** React.js · FastAPI · PostgreSQL (6 tables) · Firebase Phone Auth · Gemini 1.5 Flash · Apify
🔗 [Live App](https://ecoreciptai.netlify.app/) · 📂 [Source Code](https://github.com/student-yashsingh/Ecorecipt-AI-DCRUST)

